});
```

This code doesn't handle network failures and data integrity issues when fetching these lists, you might need to integrate it with a library like `axios` for HTTP requests or use some other means to retrieve your data. For error handling of such scenarios, promises will help you catch any errors thrown in asynchronous operations.

