    <dependency>
        <groupId>org.slf4j</groupId>
        <artifactId>slf4j-simple</artifactId>
        <version>1.7.30</version>
    </dependency>
</dependencies>
```
Note: This code assumes that the log file is small enough to fit into memory and doesn't handle large files or distributed environments. For such cases, you would need to use a streaming approach, possibly with Akka Streams for concurrent and resilient processing of data. Also, logging framework can be replaced with something else like Logback or Log4j2 according to your application needs and preferences.
